{"about_the_game":"<u><strong>Murder at the Birch Tree Theater</strong>: A Musical Theater Murder Mystery</u><br><br>Uncover high drama in this whodunnit set in a small-town community theater!  Gather clues by investigating the sets, casts and backstage crews of 10 theatrical productions, using their stories to piece together each deadly crime.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/extras/6b7b3976ed3b0d4df6b32317620e475f.webp?t=1772336506\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/extras/6b7b3976ed3b0d4df6b32317620e475f.poster.avif?t=1772336506\" class=\"bb_img\" width=178 height=197 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Explore the theater for clues</strong><br>The game features 10 levels -- each focused on a deadly incident that occurs during a performance.<br><br><strong>Solve mysteries</strong><br>Gather clues and observe each scenario to deduce what happened. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/extras/aeba795a5632f5b6c4fa6ced8d2222ab.webp?t=1772336506\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/extras/aeba795a5632f5b6c4fa6ced8d2222ab.poster.avif?t=1772336506\" class=\"bb_img\" width=520 height=520 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Piece it together</strong><br>Infer the story from clues and environments, then fill in the blanks to progress.<br><br><strong>Take a backstage tour</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every level features a theatrical production that is incorporated into the puzzles and environment.<br></li><li>The soundtrack draws inspiration from Broadway musicals of the 20th century.<br></li><li>The all-animal cast has been lovingly hand-drawn, and is full of rich backstories, dilemmas, and desires.  <br></li><li>A larger narrative is inferred through clues and environmental storytelling.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/extras/9afb44c2966839fb52c36af1ad15ba76.webp?t=1772336506\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/extras/9afb44c2966839fb52c36af1ad15ba76.poster.avif?t=1772336506\" class=\"bb_img\" width=344 height=560 /></picture></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2864590?t=1772336506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/1e8375f1930d22f43dd888ad98fe73b54c86ada6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772336506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/d0c65015d41d0013191f3bca372f162fb789ed19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772336506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864590/d0c65015d41d0013191f3bca372f162fb789ed19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772336506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3076650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<u><strong>Murder at the Birch Tree Theater</strong>: A Musical Theater Murder Mystery</u><br><br>Uncover high drama in this whodunnit set in a small-town community theater!  Gather clues by investigating the sets, casts and backstage crews of 10 theatrical productions, using their stories to piece together each deadly crime.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://s